#==============================================================================================
#
#   css_import_rule - CSS::CSSImportRule: an @import rule and the style sheet it loads
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/CSSImportRule.cpp (lines 1-310) and the inline members of
#       CSSImportRule.h (lines 22-70): the URL, layer, supports condition and media list of the
#       rule, fetching the imported style sheet (phase 2: fetch_a_style_resource reaches the
#       Fetch stubs), its serialization and the dump. CSSImportRule is also a critical
#       subresource of its parent style sheet (CSSStyleSheet::Subresource, a mixin here).
